   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Binc Stereo — video chain\n\n`LoadVideo` → `GetVideoComponents.images` → **Depth Anything V2** → **Depth Temporal Filter** → **Stereo from Depth** → **eye L** and **eye R** as separate videos (the node's `left` / `right` outputs; `sbs` and `anaglyph` are for QC only).\n\n- Put your clip in `ComfyUI/input/` and pick it in `LoadVideo`.\n- Weights: the DA2 node lists folders found in `<package>/models/` and `ComfyUI/models/depth_anything/`.\n- DA2 normalises once per sequence so `convergence` holds across the clip. Feed the whole clip as one batch; for long 4K clips trim a window first (`ImageFromBatch`) — a 4K float batch is ~100 MB per frame.\n- Check `parallax_vis` first: near objects must read **dark**; if not, flip `depth_polarity`.\n- `report.summary.ok` false = a frame broke the parallax budget — adjust `convergence` or the budgets."
   ],
   "title": "READ FIRST"
  },
